678 0 obj
<<
/Title (predictable typosquatted or lookalike variants of its primary domain to prevent abuse by third parties. Victoria's Secret employs MarkMonitor, one of the world's leading brand protection and domain management firms, to hold these registrations. Domains under MarkMonitor nameservers \(ns1.markmonitor.com\) or Cloudflare are considered brand-controlled and pose no threat in their current state. Of the 131 variants enumerated, 63 domains are confirmed brand-owned. These are grouped below by fuzzer type to show the defensive coverage pattern. While no immediate threat action is required, these domains should be periodically verified to detect any unexpected nameserver changes, which would indicate a domain has been transferred away from MarkMonitor control.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 597 0 R
/Prev 677 0 R
